      "relation": "exact",
      "statement_original": "The stable rank of a non-zero matrix $M\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}_{\\geq0}$ is given by:\n\\[\nr(M)=\\frac{\\operatorname{tr}(M)}{\\|M\\|}.\n\\]",
